\ redirect-log.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 8
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch08/redirect-log.8th
\
\ defer:/w:is, used for its second job (Chapter 3 already used it for
\ the first: a forward reference). Here, a word's actual behavior
\ changes at runtime -- nothing that calls "log" needs to know or care.

defer: emit-log   \ s --

: emit-log-console  \ s --
  . cr ;

' emit-log-console w:is emit-log

: log  \ s --
  emit-log ;

"hello" log

"" var, captured

: emit-log-capture  \ s --
  captured @ swap s:+ captured ! ;

' emit-log-capture w:is emit-log

"world" log
captured @ . cr    \ => world

bye
